@startuml
title User Profile Flow (View + Update Avatar)

actor User
participant "Landing/Pomodoro\nAvatar Button" as Entry
participant "Next.js Router" as Router
participant "ProfilePage\n(React component)" as Page
participant "useAuth hook" as Auth
participant "useProfile hook" as ProfileHook
participant "apiClient\n(Axios)" as API
participant "FastAPI /profile\nrouter" as APIProfile
participant "Security\nget_current_user_id" as Sec
participant "ProfileService" as Service
participant "DB\n(users, study_sessions)" as DB
participant "Uploads\n/uploads/avatars" as Uploads

== Navigate to profile ==
User -> Entry: click avatar
Entry -> Router: router.push("/profile")
Router -> Page: render ProfilePage
Page -> Auth: get auth state\n(token, user)
Page -> ProfileHook: fetchProfile()

== Fetch profile ==
ProfileHook -> API: GET /profile/me\nAuthorization: Bearer token
API -> Sec: validate JWT, get user_id
Sec -> APIProfile: pass user_id
APIProfile -> Service: get_profile(user_id)
Service -> DB: load user, sum study_sessions\n(completed TRUE)
DB --> Service: user + total_minutes
Service -> APIProfile: ProfileResponse\n(total_study_hours)
APIProfile -> API: 200 OK\nprofile payload
API --> ProfileHook: profile data
ProfileHook -> Page: set profile state\n(show name, email, avatar, hours)

== Upload avatar ==
User -> Page: select image in AvatarUpload
Page -> ProfileHook: uploadAvatar(file)
ProfileHook -> API: POST /profile/me/avatar\nmultipart/form-data + token
API -> Sec: validate JWT -> user_id
API -> APIProfile: handle upload
APIProfile -> Uploads: save file\n/uploads/avatars/{user_id}.ext
APIProfile -> Service: update_profile(user_id, avatar_url)
Service -> DB: update user.avatar_url
Service -> Service: recalc total_study_hours
Service -> APIProfile: updated ProfileResponse
APIProfile -> API: 200 OK\nupdated profile
API --> ProfileHook: new profile
ProfileHook -> Auth: dispatch "profile-updated"\nrefresh auth user
ProfileHook -> Page: update UI\n(new avatar shown)

@enduml

